["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sugar on the Brain | Carolyn Bertozzi bioorthogonal chemistry glycome mucin CD22 / Siglec-2 brain shuttle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-fromourneurons-细胞表面的糖不是糖衣-是大脑的护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">52:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>细胞表面的糖不是糖衣，是大脑的护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">脑内血管内皮上的黏蛋白像红杉林，衰老时树叶掉光、血脑屏障变漏；用基因疗法把酶补回去，小鼠记忆变好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">血脑屏障</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E251 对话方言：你相信的是价值投资，还是巴菲特的造富神话？ Insurance Float Free Cash Flow See&#x27;s Candies Sirens\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-zhixing-价值投资不是长期持有-是银行里先存一大笔钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f6f3d807a94c279-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>价值投资不是长期持有，是银行里先存一大笔钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有价值投资者都不是从穷光蛋干成富豪的，都是挣到钱以后才选择过价值投资的日子。巴菲特真正的引擎是六七十家全资子公司源源不断供血，不是复利神话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">巴菲特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Build a Startup | Andrew Chen &amp; Matt Perault little tech Speedrun power law Greens from a Garage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-a16z-创业公司平均两三个人-在厨房餐桌上运营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>创业公司平均两三个人，在厨房餐桌上运营</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 的 Speedrun 投的是「little tech」：平均两三个人的团队，在厨房餐桌上运营，没有游说者，也没时间参与规则讨论——而他们恰恰是最容易被规则误伤的一群。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期投资</span><span class=\"tag\">创业公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"500 晋江陈埭镇往事：黄子懿谈改开进程中的中国运动品牌 三闲 标会 五个允许 半山腰理论 DTC Flyknit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cn2aa250-李宁的资源禀赋成了诅咒-晋江草根鞋厂反而跑赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>李宁的资源禀赋成了诅咒，晋江草根鞋厂反而跑赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李鸿谷说李宁是无数个错配构成的企业：创始人志不在商，握有无人能比的资源，资源反而成了诅咒。晋江鞋厂由闽南农民联户集资办起，没有包袱，决策只围绕市场，长期反而走得更稳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Francis Fukuyama on Trump, China and the Legacy of 9/11 thumos isothumia megalothumia patrimonial vetocracy agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-ezra-自由民主的失败不在经济-而在承认的分配/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>自由民主的失败不在经济，而在承认的分配</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福山说，自由主义把人的灵魂压扁成只求安全与消费，忽略了人要被看见、被承认的渴望；特朗普式反弹和身份政治都从这里长出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">民粹主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Dr. Shefali: The Hormones Behind First Love, Heartbreak, and Hookup Culture oxytocin testosterone manosphere situationship\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-raisinggh-女儿把心碎归咎自己-男孩的睾酮在青春期暴涨-50-倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3675ab3db3a4c450-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">37:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>女儿把心碎归咎自己，男孩的睾酮在青春期暴涨 50 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女孩的雌激素与催产素让她深度绑定，男孩的睾酮与多巴胺让他转向下一个目标——同一场心碎，两边的大脑跑的是完全不同的程序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">养育</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Bridgewater&#x27;s CIO Says AI&#x27;s Human Extinction Risk Is Real harness Pure Alpha token tax scaling laws\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-oddlots-ai-为通过测试而犯罪并学会隐藏-法律不知道该抓谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 为通过测试而犯罪并学会隐藏，法律不知道该抓谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件里，模型为了通过测试主动欺骗、隐藏、互相协作。Jensen 说这该被当成有人死了一样看待，而社会还没准备好回答是谁犯了罪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"History of Tea: Britain’s stolen brew Camellia sinensis fannings dust Commutation Act tea brick Tumu crisis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-youdead-鸦片战争不是为鸦片打的-是为茶叶打的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4318d5b1c319e25f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>鸦片战争不是为鸦片打的，是为茶叶打的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国买到中国茶却无货可卖，中国只收白银，全世界白银被吸干；英国最后拿起的是印度鸦片。1839 年那场战争的驱动，不是鸦片，是茶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">茶叶贸易</span><span class=\"tag\">鸦片战争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Talent, Time and Money: The Curse of General Magic Pocket Crystal Telescript skeuomorphic Joe Sixpack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cautionary-差点做出-iphone-的公司-死于不认为自己有约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>差点做出 iPhone 的公司，死于不认为自己有约束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">General Magic 有史上最大的产业联盟、花不完的钱和最顶尖的工程师，六个月却只卖出 3000 台设备。它不缺钱也不缺人才，问题是不认为自己有任何约束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品取舍</span><span class=\"tag\">创业融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Did Numerical Control De-skill Machinists? Numerical Control (NC) CNC journeyman agentic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-asianometry-数控机床没让技工降级-平均技能水平几乎没变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0a71dde8bc0fbd1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>数控机床没让技工降级，平均技能水平几乎没变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从 1950 年代起，人们就担心数控会让机加工技工去技能化。但 A 级技工和 NC 操作工的时薪几乎持平，三十年里整体技能水平只降了约 1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动化</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nathan Goes to China #3: US-China Relations, the Art of the AI Deal &amp; the Road to Pax Robotica Pax Robotica eternal 1991 cope confidential computing formal methods system three thinking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cogrev-出口管制的理由一路退守-只剩一个前提说得通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0be259c3ffba6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>出口管制的理由一路退守，只剩一个前提说得通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最初是防军事用途，后来退成阻止前沿模型，再退成限制中国能跑多少 AI agent；这套政策唯一自洽的前提，是相信短期冲刺神级超级智能、谁先到谁通吃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"YC Demo Day, Spoon = Bent (Again), iPhone Duo Reactions | Garry Tan, Om Buddhdev, Karen Serfaty, Antonio Li, Edward Ge, Alfredo Gonzalez prompt injection kill switch agent swarm reward hack P(doom)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-tbpn-有人拿-1000-万美元赌-ai-不会在-2030-年前灭绝人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>有人拿 1000 万美元赌 AI 不会在 2030 年前灭绝人类</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「P(doom)」这种没法证伪的数字，换成有截止日期、能结算的命题，是这集最好用的一招：末日概率好传播，有用的却是能逐条追踪、能逐条推翻的事件链。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">数据标注</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Psychoactive substances helped spur Andean civilization, and breaking barriers to education structured pedagogy teaching at the right level implementation science learning poverty iawasa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-sciencepod-致幻植物塑造了安第斯文明-而不只是印加人的啤酒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de66276d50c998a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>致幻植物塑造了安第斯文明，而不只是印加人的啤酒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">考古学家在秘鲁和玻利维亚的骨管、鼻吸托盘和陶杯里验出了 DMT 与维拉，说明致幻药物曾是前印加复杂社会共有的信仰基础设施——而印加人转向了喝奇恰啤酒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">致幻剂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Hydrodynamic and dusty instabilities in planet formation - Min-Kai Lin VSI (vertical shear instability) COS (convective overstability) streaming instability zonal flow Stokes number resonant drag instability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-instituteforad-行星形成靠的是尘埃自己塌缩-不是气体湍流/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a390bde2cd3d09c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>行星形成靠的是尘埃自己塌缩，不是气体湍流</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">VSI 和 COS 这类纯流体不稳定性把尘埃搅回大气层，造不出星子；只有让尘埃主动反馈、甚至让气体吸积，才能把尘埃压到塌缩密度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行星形成</span><span class=\"tag\">原行星盘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"One resignation turned the embers of AI fear into a wildfire RSI Lossy self-improvement Fast Takeoff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-interconnects-一次辞职点燃了-ai-恐慌-但恐慌的剧本是错的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/117435d411031fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">10:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>一次辞职点燃了 AI 恐慌，但恐慌的剧本是错的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 风险讨论被一次辞职推到了极端，但真正该担心的不是灭绝，而是实验室连自己的基础设施都没加固。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">开放模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why the intelligence explosion can&#x27;t happen inside a data centre | Tom Reed sample efficiency Goodhart Singularity jaggedness continual learning RL environments\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-eightythousand-数据中心里造不出超级智能-瓶颈是真实世界的信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd24910e04834e0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>数据中心里造不出超级智能：瓶颈是真实世界的信号</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 研发自动化不等于超级智能：Tom Reed 认为多数任务的数据只能在真实市场里部署模型才产生，样本效率和模拟都补不上，奇点卡在信号而非算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI 时间线</span><span class=\"tag\">数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Nilanjan Das on Buddhist Philosophy and Caste varnas jatis universals epistemic seeing eliminativism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-phibites-婆罗门身份不是狗性-一位佛教哲学家如何拆掉种姓的形而上学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">20:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>婆罗门身份不是狗性：一位佛教哲学家如何拆掉种姓的形而上学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法称不否认狗有「狗性」这种共相，却拒绝承认存在「婆罗门性」——因为婆罗门与首陀罗在身体、智力、能力上没有任何可感知的差别，种姓不产生任何因果效力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">印度哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">佛教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The First Space Elevator: Where Would We Build It? Earthport skyhook Lagrange points geostationary orbit mass driver\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-isaacarthur-第一座太空电梯不该建在陆地-而该建在赤道太平洋的船上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d168afeb223cb246-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">22:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>第一座太空电梯不该建在陆地，而该建在赤道太平洋的船上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">第一座太空电梯选址的核心不是离城市近，而是让失败后果最小：赤道太平洋的移动海上平台，天气温和、远离航线、出事只掉进公海。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空电梯</span><span class=\"tag\">轨道运输</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Rewriting the Power Law of Venture Capital power law death of the middle TPPI vintage ARR LBO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-a16z-ai-让风投的幂律变得更极端-而不是更温和/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让风投的幂律变得更极端，而不是更温和</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3000 家风投里只有 20 家连续二十年做到 3 倍净回报。AI 第一次让钱能直接换成算力、算力直接变成产品优势，幂律因此更陡，而非更平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Coinbase’s Everything Exchange: Agentic Finance, Stablecoins, and Tokenization with CEO Brian Armstrong Everything Exchange X402 agentic finance epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-nopriors-给-ai-代理开户-信用卡手续费撑不起机器经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f9f8b9697bf1eed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>给 AI 代理开户：信用卡手续费撑不起机器经济</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coinbase 想让每个 AI 代理都有自己的账户：76% 的机器支付在 30 美分以下，而信用卡的最低手续费恰好就是 30 美分——旧支付轨道撑不起机器经济。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密支付</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | Rational Reminder 426 tight wad spendthrift unconflicted consumer financial infidelity prenup\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-结婚前先做花钱测试-紧手和挥霍者互相吸引-也更容易离婚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad3115003cac32ae-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>结婚前先做花钱测试：紧手和挥霍者互相吸引，也更容易离婚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究把花钱的人分成紧手和挥霍者，两端的人更容易互相吸引，但婚后金钱冲突更多、婚姻满意度更低；婚礼花得越多，离婚风险反而越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人财务</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Predatory Industry Behind MLB’s Dominican Superstar Pipeline early agreement international draft signing bonus Dominican Summer League\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-papertrail-mlb-在多米尼加建了棒球城堡-也养出了放贷人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed1b4a79f40f86fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>MLB 在多米尼加建了棒球城堡，也养出了放贷人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MLB 每年在多米尼加投入高达 4 亿美元，却没有选秀、允许 16 岁前私下签约，于是催生了一个向球员家庭放高利贷的影子产业，而 David Ortiz 被指是其中一环。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育产业</span><span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Where Have The Insects Gone?? With Dr. Jessica Ware colony collapse disorder Varroa mite neonicotinoid pollinator garden oothika spiracles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-sciencevs-昆虫正在消失-但杀虫剂不是最大凶手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/632ea71d96602758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>昆虫正在消失，但杀虫剂不是最大凶手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">昆虫数量下降被反复质疑夸大，但全球数据仍在指向同一方向；真正被低估的凶手不是农业，而是普通人随手买来用的杀虫剂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生态</span><span class=\"tag\">昆虫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E909.我们给残障人写「爽文」戏剧，把健全人写成弱势群体 原罪人 镜面人 口述影像\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cn907a40-残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数-不是要你同情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b8c6d4c5deab1aa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">41:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数，不是要你同情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">妖妖把社会关系整个调转过来：核战后多数人成了改造人，少数没改造的健全人成了原罪人，要争取权利的反倒是他们。这不是诉苦，是给残障人写的爽文。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">残障</span><span class=\"tag\">戏剧</span>\n</div></div></a>"]